description:
Write a generic ring buffer and three generic helpers.

```csharp
public class RingBuffer<T>(int capacity)
{
    public int Count { get; }
    public bool IsFull { get; }
    public void Add(T item)          // when full, the oldest item is overwritten
    public T this[int index] { get; } // 0 is the oldest item; ArgumentOutOfRangeException outside 0..Count-1
    public List<T> ToList()          // oldest first
}

public static class Generic
{
    public static T Clamp<T>(T value, T min, T max) where T : IComparable<T>
    public static (T Min, T Max) MinMax<T>(IEnumerable<T> items) where T : IComparable<T>   // InvalidOperationException when empty
    public static TValue GetOrCreate<TKey, TValue>(Dictionary<TKey, TValue> map, TKey key)
        where TKey : notnull where TValue : new()       // the existing value, or a new TValue() stored under key
}
```

The capacity must be 1 or more (`ArgumentOutOfRangeException` in the constructor).

